{"availability":"available","full":"withkarann/aifoxx","name":"aifoxx","description":"992 AI tools, 1,979 MCP servers and 1,638 Claude Code skills — with a sourced trust & security report per vendor. If we couldn't verify it, the field stays empty.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":17,"created":"2026-03-13T16:29:17Z","updated":"2026-10-16T06:12:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aifoxx.com","topics":["ai-directory","ai-tools","artificial-intelligence","directory","open-source","react","tailwindcss","tools-list","typescript","vite","zod"],"demo":"https://aifoxx.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:03.169Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:03.169Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:03.169Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","stars":8,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:26.206Z","stars":8,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:58.614Z","stars":8,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:49.034Z","stars":8,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:23:30.147Z","stars":8,"forks":15},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:33:03.169Z","stars":9,"forks":17}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every compliance claim links to the vendor page that proves it. Where a fact is unverified, the field stays empty instead of guessed.","Most AI directories are a wall of logos. AIFOXX records the things that are genuinely hard to compare across vendor marketing pages, and it sources every claim:","The tool page shows a compact summary. The full Trust & Security Report at /trust/:slug goes deeper: the complete certification list (SOC 2, ISO 27001, ISO 42001, GDPR, HIPAA, PCI DSS, and more) with a sourced quote for each, data-processing-agreement and data-region details, per-product data scope, and a \"what to watch\" summary. The summary and the report are driven by the same data, so they never disagree."],"features":["💰 Pricing | Free, Freemium, Paid, or Open Source, with free-tier, paid-plan, and API-cost notes where known.","🔒 Compliance | SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR, and HIPAA flags. Every flag set to true links to the vendor's own trust center, security page, or privacy policy.","🗄️ Data handling | Hosting region, whether the vendor trains on customer data, and whether the tool is self-hostable.","🚪 Access methods | Web, mobile, desktop, API, and more."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/withkarann/aifoxx/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e96d9f5e1e4ab5458b2cedd8f585110a885cc9475514df78561ea0e39096d4f0","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:18.548Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:08.201Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Every compliance claim links to the vendor page that proves it. Where a fact is unverified, the field stays empty instead of guessed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/withkarann/aifoxx/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e96d9f5e1e4ab5458b2cedd8f585110a885cc9475514df78561ea0e39096d4f0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/withkarann/aifoxx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:08.201Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T06:13:24Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:10.260Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/withkarann/aifoxx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T01:12:08.202Z","hash":"e96d9f5e1e4ab5458b2cedd8f585110a885cc9475514df78561ea0e39096d4f0","originalBytes":9148,"storedBytes":9148,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T17:15:32.495Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.2.10","tag":"v1.2.10","publishedAt":"2026-10-01T13:23:19Z","url":"https://github.com/withkarann/aifoxx/releases/tag/v1.2.10"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T17:15:32.495Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/1685fe8509c1f02ee7a500e6.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T21:48:16.257Z","url":"https://aifoxx.com/"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:48:16.257Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://aifoxx.com/","at